From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abue Ammar <14371506+abue-ammar@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 06:51:07 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] Edit clipboard text entries in place (#1642)

* feat(clipboard): add Edit Entry functionality and improve clipboard management

- Implemented the ability to edit text entries in the clipboard with a new dialog.
- Added a new `ClipboardEditField` for editing clipboard text entries.
- Updated `ClipboardScreen` to handle edit actions and reveal clips in Finder.
- Enhanced the clipboard actions menu to include Edit Entry and Show in Finder options.
- Updated localization for new features and improved user experience.
- Adjusted key shortcuts for editing and showing entries in Finder.

* Drop a comment that restated its token

* Fix clipboard edit selection and save failures

* Hold clipboard edits to the capture length limit
